It is Thursday evening, and I am at home.
I pack my sports bag.
I put my shoes and my clothes in the bag.
I look forward to playing tonight.
I take the bus to a large sports hall.
It is a cold winter evening.
I sit in the bus and look out.
The bus stops, and I get out.
I walk into the large sports hall.
It is very bright.
I see many people in the hall.
They love to play sports.
I hear a loud sound.
The shoes squeak on the many wooden courts.
People run fast and play together.
It looks very fun.
I am ready to play.
But first I need to rent a racket.
